{
  "Id": "tutorial.05.scripted",
  "DisplayName": "教程5 脚本化模块",
  "Description": "Scripted 节点按 ModuleName 分派到 C# 脚本模块：print（打字机）/ announce（通知）/ log。这些是内置模块（B6），无需额外注册即可用。",
  "MissionType": "Chill",
